{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Kjey PAPA — inbound webhooks for Sambat LOS",
    "version": "2026-11-05",
    "description": "The seven endpoints Sambat LOS calls on Kjey PAPA. This file contains ONLY those endpoints; the rest of our API is not part of this integration.\n\n**Every timestamp must be a full ISO-8601 instant** (2026-08-21T09:00:00Z). A bare date is rejected with HTTP 400 naming the field.\n\nAll responses use the envelope {type, message, data}. A 200 means delivered — including a no-op, whose message begins \"Ignored —\". Handlers are idempotent, so re-delivery after a network failure is safe.\n\n**Every call must carry the shared secret** in the X-LOS-Signature header; it is sent to you separately. Without it, or with a wrong one, the answer is HTTP 401 and nothing is processed.\n\nIdentify the application by mobileAppId, our id for it, which we send in /new-loan-application. Until your callbacks switch, a body without it may name the application by your LOS AppId in appId. A miss answers NOT_FOUND naming what was looked for; a body naming no application answers HTTP 400.\n\nSee PDL_Our_Webhook_Endpoints_for_LOS.docx for the narrative version.",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Kjey PAPA (Ezetik)"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://kjeypapa-uat.sambatfinance.com.kh",
      "description": "Kjey PAPA UAT. The production host will be confirmed before go-live."
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "09- LOS Webhook API",
      "description": "Sambat LOS inbound notifications (server-to-server)"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/pdl/los/rework": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "09- LOS Webhook API"
        ],
        "operationId": "rework",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LosNotificationPayload"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SUCCESS (applied, or a no-op whose message starts \"Ignored —\"), or NOT_FOUND naming the identifier looked for.",
            "content": {
              "*/*": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageString"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
